; DOMAIN: iwasawa-main-conjecture [CLOSED, derived 2026-07-25]
; Claim: The Iwasawa Main Conjecture (Mazur-Wiles, Wiles, Skinner-Urban) is the p-adic descent instance of ETNC. Over the cyclotomic Z_p-extension K_infty/K with Lambda=Z_p[[Gamma]]=Z_p[[T]], let X_infty be the Pontryagin dual of the p-primary Selmer group and L_p the p-adic L-function (Kubota-Leopoldt / Mazur-Swinnerton-Dyer). Both are torsion Lambda-modules; the structure theorem up to pseudo-isomorphism assigns each a characteristic ideal. The Main Conjecture asserts char_Lambda(X_infty) = (L_p) as ideals of Lambda. One divisibility is proved by Euler systems (Kolyvagin/Kato bounding Selmer above by L_p), the reverse by Mazur-Wiles/Skinner-Urban (Eisenstein congruences). Specializing the Lambda-module tower at T=0 recovers the finite-level Bloch-Kato/Tamagawa equality; ETNC over Lambda[G] descends character-by-character to this identity, making the Main Conjecture the p-adic Iwasawa-theoretic shadow of the equivariant fundamental line.
; Bridge: genesis_equivariant_tamagawa (the Main Conjecture is the Lambda[G]-descent specialization of ETNC: the equivariant fundamental line over the Iwasawa algebra descends to char_Lambda(Selmer)=(L_p), and T=0 specialization recovers the finite-level Bloch-Kato equality per character) + genesis_perrin_riou (Perrin-Riou's big exponential and Coleman map realize the p-adic L-function L_p as the image of the Euler system under the regulator, giving the analytic side char ideal = (L_p)) + genesis_euler_system (Kolyvagin/Kato derived classes bound char_Lambda(X_infty) above by (L_p), supplying the divisibility half of the Main Conjecture).
(= (iwasawa-algebra) (power-series (z-p) (gamma)))
(= (selmer-dual) (pontryagin-dual (p-primary-selmer)))
(= (char-ideal $M) (characteristic-ideal (iwasawa-algebra) (torsion-module $M)))
(= (main-conjecture) (equal (char-ideal (selmer-dual)) (ideal (p-adic-l-function))))
(= (specialize (main-conjecture) (t-equals 0)) (bloch-kato-finite-level))
(= (descends (etnc $M (lambda-group)) (main-conjecture)) (p-adic-shadow))